import json,html
from pathlib import Path
ROOT=Path(__file__).parent.parent/'output';out=ROOT/'household-final-e2e'
read=lambda name:json.loads((out/name).read_text())
state=read('workflow.json');offline=read('offline.json');mobile=read('mobile-capture.json');restored=read('device-restoration.json');cleanup=read('fixture-cleanup.json');ui=[read(phase+'-ui.json') for phase in ['review','level1','level2','published']];preserved=json.loads((ROOT/'ooru-meeting-audit/verification/preservation.json').read_text())
assert all(x['status']=='passed' for x in [state,offline,restored,preserved,*ui]) and cleanup['status']=='completed'
checks=''.join('<li>'+html.escape(x)+'</li>' for x in state['checks'])
page=f'''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Fresh mobile household workflow test</title><style>body{{font:16px/1.6 system-ui;background:#f1f5f0;color:#173e34;margin:0}}main{{max-width:1050px;margin:24px auto;padding:28px;background:white;border:1px solid #d2dfd3;border-radius:16px}}h1,h2,a{{color:#155e50}}li{{margin:10px 0}}img{{max-width:100%;border:1px solid #d2dfd3;border-radius:12px}}.phone{{max-width:390px}}</style><main><h1>Fresh mobile capture to Master Registry: passed</h1><p>13 November 2026 · New fictional household captured on the connected Android 16 phone using ODK Collect v2026.3.5, form {html.escape(state['version'])}. This run used a new physical interview, not a replay of an earlier submission.</p><h2>Workflow verification</h2><ul>{checks}</ul><p>The phone captured GPS in airplane mode with {html.escape(str(mobile['gpsAccuracyMetres']))} metre accuracy. The draft was reopened; its submission ID and GPS capture time remained stable. Automatic sending was verified by confirming the submission was absent from the servers before reconnecting, then appeared without pressing Send. Actual coordinates are omitted from this report. Nigeria administrative selections were fictional test values.</p><h2>Labels and layouts</h2><p>Passed {sum(len(x['checks']) for x in ui)} browser checks at 1440px desktop and 390px mobile widths: registration-review cards/list/detail, both independent approval queues and decision forms, and published master cards/list/detail and all household tabs. Both approval decisions were submitted through the visible UI. No raw underscore codes, audited spelling errors, clipped text, page overflow or JavaScript errors remained in the checked views.</p><p>One remaining issue was found and fixed: the populated master card displayed CORRUGATED_IRON instead of the selected reference label. Native cards now resolve known reference values to their readable names; the deployed correction was retested against the published household. Stored codes and identifiers remain unchanged.</p><h2>Cleanup and preservation</h2><p>The temporary phone project, its credentials and the UUID-tracked server fixture were removed after publication evidence was recorded. Original phone connectivity, location and sleep settings were verified restored. Historical reconciliation passed: {preserved['native_rows_verified']} native rows and {preserved['awe_rows_verified']} original approval-history rows unchanged. Master totals returned to {preserved['households']} households and {preserved['individuals']} individuals.</p><p><a href="workflow.json">Workflow evidence</a> · <a href="offline.json">Offline capture</a> · <a href="review-ui.json">Registration review</a> · <a href="level1-ui.json">First approval</a> · <a href="level2-ui.json">Second approval</a> · <a href="published-ui.json">Published registry</a> · <a href="device-restoration.json">Phone restoration</a></p><h2>Published household after the label correction</h2><img src="published-cards-1440.png" alt="Newly published fictional household in the Master Registry"><h2>Second approval on mobile layout</h2><img class="phone" src="level2-actions-390.png" alt="Second approval controls and comment field in mobile layout"></main></html>'''
(out/'verification.html').write_text(page,encoding='utf-8');print('Built fresh physical-mobile workflow verification report')
